---
// The one thing Eye Rest Reminder cannot do for you: Android hides "Display
// over other apps" behind a menu most people never open. Drawn in CSS as three
// phone screens rather than shipped as real screenshots, because every OEM skin
// looks different — this shows the shape of the journey, not one phone's pixels.
---

<div class="guide">
  <ol class="steps">
    <!-- 1 — Settings, find the app -->
    <li class="step">
      <div class="phone">
        <span class="notch"></span>
        <div class="bar">
          <i class="back"></i>
          <span class="bar-title">Apps</span>
        </div>
        <div class="rows">
          <div class="row"><i class="ico i-a"></i><span class="lbl w60"></span></div>
          <div class="row hot">
            <i class="ico i-eye">👁</i>
            <span class="lbl-text">Eye Rest Reminder</span>
            <i class="tap" aria-hidden="true"></i>
          </div>
          <div class="row"><i class="ico i-c"></i><span class="lbl w45"></span></div>
          <div class="row"><i class="ico i-d"></i><span class="lbl w55"></span></div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="cap"><b>1.</b> Settings → <b>Apps</b>, then tap <b>Eye Rest Reminder</b> to open App info.</p>
    </li>

    <!-- 2 — the three dots -->
    <li class="step">
      <div class="phone">
        <span class="notch"></span>
        <div class="bar">
          <i class="back"></i>
          <span class="bar-title">App info</span>
          <span class="dots hot-dots">
            <i></i><i></i><i></i>
            <span class="ping"></span>
          </span>
        </div>
        <div class="appinfo">
          <span class="app-ico">👁</span>
          <span class="app-name">Eye Rest Reminder</span>
          <span class="lbl w40 center"></span>
        </div>
        <div class="rows">
          <div class="row"><span class="lbl w50"></span></div>
          <div class="row"><span class="lbl w65"></span></div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="cap"><b>2.</b> Tap the <b>⋮ three dots</b> in the top-right corner.</p>
    </li>

    <!-- 3 — the menu item -->
    <li class="step">
      <div class="phone">
        <span class="notch"></span>
        <div class="bar">
          <i class="back"></i>
          <span class="bar-title">App info</span>
          <span class="dots"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span>
        </div>
        <div class="menu">
          <div class="menu-item">All apps</div>
          <div class="menu-item hot">Display over other apps<i class="tap"></i></div>
          <div class="menu-item">Modify system settings</div>
        </div>
        <div class="rows dim">
          <div class="row"><span class="lbl w50"></span></div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="cap"><b>3.</b> Choose <b>Display over other apps</b> and turn it on.</p>
    </li>
  </ol>

  <p class="guide-note">
    Exact wording varies by phone — Samsung calls it <em>Appear on top</em>, and some
    skins list it under <em>Special access</em>. Without it Android silently blocks the
    reminder, so the timer runs but nothing ever appears.
  </p>
</div>

<style>
  .guide { --tint: var(--note-blue); }

  .steps {
    list-style: none;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 1.4rem;
  }
  .step { display: grid; gap: 0.9rem; justify-items: center; }

  /* ---- the phone ---- */
  .phone {
    position: relative;
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 230px;
    /* squatter than a real phone — sized to the content, not to a device */
    aspect-ratio: 3 / 4;
    border-radius: 22px;
    padding: 16px 10px 10px;
    overflow: hidden;
    background: linear-gradient(170deg, #171a22, #101219);
    box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 1px var(--line), 0 24px 44px -28px #000;
  }
  .notch {
    position: absolute;
    top: 7px;
    left: 50%;
    transform: translateX(-50%);
    width: 42px;
    height: 4px;
    border-radius: 3px;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.14);
  }

  .bar {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    padding: 4px 4px 10px;
  }
  .back {
    width: 8px;
    height: 8px;
    border-left: 2px solid var(--muted);
    border-bottom: 2px solid var(--muted);
    transform: rotate(45deg);
    flex: none;
  }
  .bar-title { font-size: 0.68rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--ink); flex: 1; }

  .dots { display: grid; gap: 2px; position: relative; flex: none; padding: 3px; }
  .dots i { width: 3px; height: 3px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--muted); }
  .hot-dots i { background: var(--tint); }
  /* a pulse drawing the eye to the corner people never look at */
  .ping {
    position: absolute;
    inset: -7px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    border: 2px solid var(--tint);
    animation: ping 2.4s ease-out infinite;
  }
  @keyframes ping {
    0%        { transform: scale(0.7); opacity: 0.9; }
    70%, 100% { transform: scale(1.5); opacity: 0; }
  }

  .rows { display: grid; gap: 6px; }
  .rows.dim { opacity: 0.35; }
  .row {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 7px;
    padding: 7px 6px;
    border-radius: 8px;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03);
  }
  .row.hot {
    background: rgba(143, 184, 255, 0.13);
    box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(143, 184, 255, 0.4);
  }
  .ico {
    width: 15px;
    height: 15px;
    border-radius: 5px;
    flex: none;
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    font-size: 8px;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
  }
  .i-eye { background: rgba(143, 184, 255, 0.25); }
  .lbl { height: 5px; border-radius: 3px; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.13); }
  .lbl-text { font-size: 0.58rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--ink); flex: 1; }
  .w40 { width: 40%; } .w45 { width: 45%; } .w50 { width: 50%; }
  .w55 { width: 55%; } .w60 { width: 60%; } .w65 { width: 65%; }
  .center { margin: 0 auto; }

  .appinfo {
    display: grid;
    justify-items: center;
    gap: 5px;
    padding: 10px 0 12px;
  }
  .app-ico {
    width: 30px; height: 30px; border-radius: 9px;
    display: grid; place-items: center; font-size: 14px;
    background: rgba(143, 184, 255, 0.22);
  }
  .app-name { font-size: 0.6rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--ink); }

  /* the dropdown */
  .menu {
    margin: 0 0 8px auto;
    width: 88%;
    padding: 5px;
    border-radius: 9px;
    background: #1e222c;
    box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 1px var(--line), 0 10px 20px -10px #000;
  }
  .menu-item {
    position: relative;
    font-size: 0.55rem;
    color: var(--muted);
    padding: 6px 7px;
    border-radius: 6px;
  }
  .menu-item.hot {
    color: #0e0d13;
    font-weight: 800;
    background: var(--tint);
  }

  /* a fingertip on the thing to press */
  .tap {
    position: absolute;
    right: 6px;
    top: 50%;
    width: 13px;
    height: 13px;
    margin-top: -6px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.85);
    box-shadow: 0 0 0 4px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.18);
    animation: tap 2.4s ease-in-out infinite;
  }
  .row.hot { position: relative; }
  @keyframes tap {
    0%, 60%, 100% { transform: scale(1); opacity: 0.85; }
    72%           { transform: scale(0.75); opacity: 1; }
  }

  .cap {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 0.86rem;
    line-height: 1.55;
    color: var(--muted);
    text-align: center;
    max-width: 30ch;
  }
  .cap b { color: var(--ink); font-weight: 700; }

  .guide-note {
    margin: 1.8rem auto 0;
    max-width: 62ch;
    text-align: center;
    font-size: 0.86rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--muted);
    padding-top: 1.2rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
  }
  .guide-note em { color: var(--ink); font-style: italic; }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .ping, .tap { animation: none; }
  }
  @media (max-width: 820px) {
    .steps { grid-template-columns: 1fr; justify-items: center; gap: 2rem; }
  }
</style>
